ha-bambulab (https://github.com/greghesp/ha-bambulab), MIT License,
Copyright (c) 2023 ha-bambulab contributors.
Printvault uses, or is built after, the following from ha-bambulab:
  - the error code texts and wiki links (bambu_errors_data.json, generated by
    scripts/update_bambu_errors.py from scripts/hms_error_text/; the texts
    themselves come from Bambu Lab) and the stage names (CURRENT_STAGE_IDS in
    pybambu/const.py);
  - the model information: which models use which camera route, and the report
    field formats per model (pybambu/models.py);
  - the camera protocol on TCP port 6000 (ChamberImageThread in
    pybambu/bambu_client.py), reimplemented in camera.py.
